<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day</p>
<p>of the first test between South Africa and Australia at the</p>
<p>Wanderers on Sunday:</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 302 (H.Cronje 76, D.Richardson 72</p>
<p>not out)</p>
<p>Australia first innings (overnight 191-4)</p>
<p>M.Taylor b Pollock			    16</p>
<p>M.Hayden c Cullinan b Pollock	     40</p>
<p>M.Elliott c Adams b Donald		  85</p>
<p>M.Waugh c Richardson b Donald	     26</p>
<p>S.Waugh not out				137</p>
<p>B.Blewett not out			    156</p>
<p>Extras (9-lb, 7-nb, 3-w)		    19</p>
<p>Total (for four wickets)		   479</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-33 2-128 3-169 4-174</p>
<p>To bat: Michael Bevan, Ian Healy, Shane Warne, Jason</p>
<p>Gillespie, Glenn McGrath</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 29-6-113-2 (2w), Pollock 26-3-82-2 (7nb),</p>
<p>Klusener 29-7-91-0, Kallis 15-4-35-0 (1w), Adams 43-4-130-0,</p>
<p>Cronje 10-3-19-0</p>
</text>
